Forgive my tears. I was moved by the farewell of the Shogoth's souls. They took shining forms, turned into glittering dust and rose to the skies like beautiful stars.

We are out of time; Yagditha opened the seal of Zairweus, his father, and freed the Black Specters of the ancient Aquarians.
Zairweus is the ancient god of the seas. He created the Aquarians, the ancient water people, and after their leader led them to rebel against their creator, Zairweus sealed them in the abyss.

I apologize once more. I must prepare the Magic Prison. The time has come to enter this war.

Go and get ready, then come back here. I will have everything ready.
